min read\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"h1\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-6 max-w-5xl font-display text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-[-0.03em] text-white\",\"children\":\"The Robotics Boom Needs a Content Engine\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-8 max-w-3xl text-xl leading-9 text-[var(--muted-foreground)] sm:text-2xl\",\"children\":\"Humanoid robotics is scaling past 22,000 units with a billion-unit horizon, but hardware scale creates a battle for attention and trust. Proven content creation practice — audience personas, pillar-and-cluster SEO, buyer's-journey mapping — is how robotics brands win. DigiRobotics pairs its data marketplace with an authority-building content engine.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-10 flex items-center gap-3 text-[14px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"grid size-10 place-items-center rounded-full border border-[var(--primary)]/40 bg-[var(--primary)]/10 font-heading text-[var(--primary)]\",\"children\":\"DR\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold\",\"children\":\"DigiRobotics Team\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-0.5 text-[12px] text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":[\"Updated \",\"November 20, 2026\"]}]]}]]}]]}]]}],\"$L5\"]}],\"$L6\"]}],null,\"$L7\"]}],\"isPartial\":\"$@8\",\"staleTime\":\"$9\",\"varyParams\":null},{\"rsc\":\"$La\",\"isPartial\":\"$@b\",\"staleTime\":\"$9\",\"varyParams\":null},{\"rsc\":\"$Lc\",\"isPartial\":\"$@d\",\"staleTime\":\"$9\",\"varyParams\":\"$e\"},{\"rsc\":\"$Lf\",\"isPartial\":\"$@10\",\"staleTime\":\"$9\",\"varyParams\":\"$e\"}],\"isUpgradeableISRFallback\":false,\"a\":\"$@11\",\"rootVaryParams\":null,\"needsRuntimeRequest\":\"$@12\"}\n1f:I[38437,[\"99489\",\"static/chunks/99489-7b4b74c1a59849db.js\",\"5772\",\"static/chunks/5772-2ad3d6bb0136fa62.js\",\"57304\",\"static/chunks/57304-ca98254065b92130.js\",\"95953\",\"static/chunks/app/blog/%5Bslug%5D/page-a38ec015cb873e3f.js\"],\"Image\"]\n24:I[90484,[],\"OutletBoundary\"]\n25:\"$Sreact.suspense\"\n27:I[90484,[],\"ViewportBoundary\"]\n28:I[90484,[],\"MetadataBoundary\"]\n29:I[86869,[],\"IconMark\"]\n2a:I[57121,[],\"\"]\n2b:I[74581,[],\"\"]\n5:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-12 px-5 py-16 sm:px-8 sm:py-24 lg:grid-cols-[170px_minmax(0,760px)] lg:justify-center\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"aside\",null,{\"className\":\"hidden lg:block\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"sticky top-28 border-t border-[var(--primary)] pt-4 font-mono text-[9px] uppercase leading-5 tracking-[0.15em] text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":[\"DigiRobotics\",[\"$\",\"br\",null,{}],\"Field note\",[\"$\",\"br\",null,{}],\"2026.11.20\"]}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"min-w-0\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"blockquote\",\"blockquote-0\",{\"className\":\"my-10 border-l-2 border-[var(--primary)] bg-[var(--primary)]/[0.06] px-6 py-2 font-heading text-xl leading-8 text-white sm:px-8\",\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-0\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"TL;DR:\"}]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-1\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"Humanoid robotics is entering industrial scale — global shipments above 22,000 units in the first half of this year, nearly 300% growth, with a billion-unit horizon now discussed openly. Hardware supply chain is racing ahead: optics, joint modules, actuators, and onboard compute are in multi-continent demand. But hardware scale creates a battle for a scarcer resource: attention and trust — every vendor competes for the same narrow community of developers, buyers, and data contributors. Proven content creation practice — audience personas, pillar-and-cluster SEO, buyer's-journey mapping, distribution discipline, AI-assisted production — is how robotics brands win. DigiRobotics pairs its data marketplace with an authority-building content engine that compounds while the market scales.\"}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-0\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 mt-6 scroll-mt-24 font-heading text-xl md:text-2xl leading-tight tracking-[-0.03em] text-white\",\"children\":\"A Billion Robots, and the Supply Chain Listens\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-0\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"The market signal is no longer speculative. Global humanoid shipments exceeded 22,000 units in the first half of this year — up roughly 300% year-on-year — with full-year volume projected past 50,000, concentrated among a handful of large manufacturers. And headline forecasts have gone further: the head of a leading vehicle-and-robotics company now projects a billion humanoid robots within twenty years, with production lines once dedicated to cars being converted to robot assembly.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-1\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"Meanwhile, the component economy is already operating day-in, day-out. Vision optics suppliers of high-precision facial-area lenses are sampling humanoid-eye cameras to customers across Asia, Europe, and North America — demand is broadening beyond any single customer before volume even ramps. Actuation means harmonic reducers and joint modules shipping at scale, with dedicated joint-venture factories under construction across multiple countries toward mass production. And compute — each humanoid functions as a mobile data center, carrying onboard inference silicon, memory, and storage for sensor capture and cloud training updates.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-1\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 mt-6 scroll-mt-24 font-heading text-xl md:text-2xl leading-tight tracking-[-0.03em] text-white\",\"children\":\"The Scarce Resource Isn't Hardware — It's Trust\"}],\"\\n\",\"$L13\",\"\\n\",\"$L14\",\"\\n\",\"$L15\",\"\\n\",\"$L16\",\"\\n\",\"$L17\",\"\\n\",\"$L18\",\"\\n\",\"$L19\",\"\\n\",\"$L1a\",\"\\n\",\"$L1b\",\"\\n\",\"$L1c\",\"\\n\",\"$L1d\"],\"$L1e\"]}]]}]\n6:[\"$\",\"footer\",null,{\"className\":\"border-t border-white/[.08] bg-[#111620] py-12\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mx-auto w-full max-w-[1440px] px-5 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 xl:px-16\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] lg:items-start\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L1f\",null,{\"src\":\"/digirobotics/brand/digirobotics-logo.png\",\"alt\":\"DigiRobotics.xyz\",\"width\":210,\"height\":48,\"className\":\"h-auto w-[190px]\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-4 text-[17px] text-white/60\",\"children\":\"Egocentric data for robotics training.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"nav\",null,{\"aria-label\":\"Footer navigation\",\"className\":\"flex max-w-2xl flex-wrap gap-x-7 gap-y-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"a\",\"Contributor\",{\"href\":\"/#contributors\",\"className\":\"min-h-11 py-3 text-[14px] font-medium text-white/65 relative transition-colors duration-300 ease-out after:absolute after:inset-x-0 after:bottom-1 after:h-px after:origin-left after:scale-x-0 after:bg-[var(--primary)] after:transition-transform after:duration-300 after:ease-out hover:text-[var(--primary)] hover:after:scale-x-100\",\"children\":\"Contributor\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",\"Marketplace\",{\"href\":\"/#marketplace\",\"className\":\"min-h-11 py-3 text-[14px] font-medium text-white/65 relative transition-colors duration-300 ease-out after:absolute after:inset-x-0 after:bottom-1 after:h-px after:origin-left after:scale-x-0 after:bg-[var(--primary)] after:transition-transform after:duration-300 after:ease-out hover:text-[var(--primary)] hover:after:scale-x-100\",\"children\":\"Marketplace\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",\"Custom Data\",{\"href\":\"/#custom-data\",\"className\":\"min-h-11 py-3 text-[14px] font-medium text-white/65 relative transition-colors duration-300 ease-ou